  "description": "Jung In-woo has a unique ability: when he touches someone, he can see their sexual fantasies. One day, he starts a new job and meets his team leader, Yoo Ha-jin.\n\nHa-jin is extremely popular thanks to his striking looks, but his obsessive dedication to work and prickly personality make him cold and difficult - he barely speaks to anyone outside of his tasks. In-woo, too, doesn’t think highly of Ha-jin, who seems to look at him like he’s a bug.\n\nBut during a company dinner, their bodies accidentally touch, and In-woo unintentionally glimpses Ha-jin’s hidden desires. To his surprise, Ha-jin has strong degrader tendencies—and he’s gay.\n\nCaught off guard by this side of Ha-jin, which is completely different from his cold, sharp exterior, In-woo finds himself thinking about him more and more…\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13893848)",
